Package: fidophir
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, kmod, udev, polkitd, libtss2-tcti-device0t64, tpm-udev
Description: experimental TPM-backed FIDO passkey authenticator
 A per-user resident ES256 authenticator using OpenSK, TPM2-TSS and
 native login1/polkit desktop approval. Each user receives a private
 authenticator automatically through their systemd user manager.
